{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nJobs and steps of the selected run from `gh run view <id> --json jobs`.\n\n## Spec\n- Tree: job → steps via the shared `nest_by` builder; status icon and duration per row\n- Failed steps highlighted; `Enter` on a job (or step) opens its log in the log pane\n\nPart of #98.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:45Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":101,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Actions: jobs pane"}
